+# Diffusers batching & autoscaling runbook (overview)
+
+This runbook explains how the dynamic batcher, Celery/Redis queue, and KEDA/Prometheus autoscaling fit together.
+
+Components
+- Redis queue "diffusers:queue" — producers push job JSON (id, prompt, params, result_key).
+- Aggregator (dynamic_batcher) — pulls up to MAX_BATCH items, performs batched inference and writes results.
